##notes##
Hiss-Linux default strategy — a minimal hand-strength demo formula.
handrank169: 1 = best starting-hand-equivalent, 169 = worst.

##f$fold##
handrank169 > 90

##f$check##
0

##f$call##
handrank169 <= 90 && handrank169 > 40

##f$raise##
handrank169 <= 40

##f$betsize##
3 * bblind

##f$beep##
0
